<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero__title">蓉城医枢 · 患者端</view>
    <view class="hero__sub">用药提醒 · 服药打卡 · 药盒识别 · 用药问答</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <view class="field__label">患者手机号</view>
      <input class="input" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入 11 位手机号"
             value="{{phone}}" data-field="phone" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="field__label">密码</view>
      <input class="input" password placeholder="请输入密码"
             value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="tip" wx:if="{{tip}}">{{tip}}</view>

    <button class="btn btn--primary" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="onSubmit">登录</button>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" bindtap="onFillDemo">填入演示账号</button>
  </view>

  <view class="disclaimer">
    本小程序只服务患者账号。医生、药师、管理员请使用 Web 工作台登录。
    演示密码统一为 123456，账号为演示用虚构数据。
  </view>
</view>
